{"data":[{"created_at":"2026-10-25T06:24:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114241578168705388"],"id":"2114241578168705388","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1641,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"听说昨晚 Tibo 咬打火机炸到嘴了，重置延迟了，你们不要等了","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114241578168705388"},{"created_at":"2026-10-25T05:29:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114227923674931483"],"id":"2114227923674931483","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":964,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113568179616436580","type":"quoted"}],"text":"选同一个系列的模型不能只看总分，具体分工边界其实分得很清楚。良哥拿 15 道陷阱题测 FUMO，第二轮装没听见后，Fusion Code 还有 90% 的拦截率，补测的 Max 2.0 则是 53%。第二轮里 Max 更习惯先问清运行环境再算，官方定位也是办公文档和复杂推理。 https://t.co/Jh0g5Vbwwd","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114227923674931483"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2114155854115254272"]},"created_at":"2026-10-25T00:43:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114155864961749241"],"id":"2114155864961749241","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1628,"like_count":8,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113798377494442291","type":"quoted"}],"text":"答疑群加入的同学已经破百啦！\n今天还有半价活动，明天恢复原价～ https://t.co/QdZaIjHI1n https://t.co/ddAUPNDAH5","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114155864961749241"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2114034631930707968"]},"created_at":"2026-10-24T16:42:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2114034716731228463"],"id":"2114034716731228463","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":1371,"like_count":25,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2113781259646419325","type":"quoted"}],"text":"猫猫和曹吉美都累了，今天真是舟车劳顿，早上 8 点出发，11 点到会场，晚上 9 点半出发，11 点 20 到慈溪，终于住下了，明天睡到自然醒！ https://t.co/h79b3iYg1k https://t.co/df2AavP8qW","url":"https://x.com/i/status/2114034716731228463"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2113954542060810241"]},"create